1
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,799
I'm off.

2
00:01:27,719 --> 00:01:28,959
Nice job on the laundry.

3
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,480
Here's your laundry fee.

4
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,840
The PIN is 123456.

5
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,560
Don't tell me...

6
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:39,920
...she thinks I did something last night,

7
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,079
...and this is an overnight fee?

8
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,719
Ma Jianguo!

9
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,280
Look at the kind of son you raised!

10
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,879
How dare he violate my daughter!

11
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,840
You owe us an explanation today!

12
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:10,960
And you, Su Hui!

13
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,000
What are you trying to pull?

14
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:13,879
Sister-in-law,

15
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:16,919
I know Dawei's family is in debt,

16
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,960
and he's under a lot of stress.

17
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,039
But...

18
00:02:20,319 --> 00:02:22,080
he still had no right to violate me!

19
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:24,879
Zhou Qian,

20
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,000
are you done with your act?

21
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,360
Just because I wouldn't bribe you,

22
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,840
you come to my house to extort us?

23
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,400
Hey!

24
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:34,240
You little bastard!

25
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,919
How dare you show your face here!

26
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,560
You have the nerve to do it, but not to admit it?

27
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,000
Come to the police station with me!

28
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:41,400
He can't go to jail!

29
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,680
Dad!

30
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,520
Why are you hitting Dawei?

31
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,080
You bastard!

32
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,800
I thought you'd turned your life around,

33
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:51,280
turns out you just did something shameful!

34
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,680
You're feeling guilty, aren't you?

35
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:53,759
That poor girl...

36
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,680
She stayed even when your brother died!

37
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:58,280
Is this how you repay her?

38
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,439
Dad!

39
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,680
What does this have to do with Dawei?

40
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,199
They're clearly the ones bullying us!

41
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,000
Shut up!

42
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,439
Get the hell out of here!

43
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:07,360
In Ma Jianguo's house,

44
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:09,439
we don't welcome troublemakers like you!

45
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,199
Get out! Get out right now!

46
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,360
Zhou Qian,

47
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,080
now that it's come to this,

48
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,599
are you satisfied?

49
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:26,479
Sister-in-law,

50
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,680
take good care of Dad.

51
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,840
I'll explain later.

52
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,719
Why doesn't he regret it at all?

53
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,280
It's as if

54
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,280
he never cared about me

55
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,560
or gave a damn about any of this.

56
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,360
Dawei!

57
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,080
Auntie,

58
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:52,840
about this...

59
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,319
Enough!

60
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,840
Just get that 100,000 together!

61
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,479
Dawei!

62
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:03,919
Dawei!

63
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:05,840
Dawei, wait!

64
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:09,919
About Zhou Qian...

65
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:12,280
Forget it.

66
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:13,759
I've made up my mind.

67
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:16,199
I'm going to sell the house back home.

68
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,759
It should help cover some of it.

69
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:19,680
Sister-in-law,

70
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,879
don't worry about the money.

71
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,000
I'll figure something out.

72
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:22,920
Besides,

73
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,439
where will your parents live?

74
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,879
You don't need to worry about that.

75
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,199
Every little bit helps.

76
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,160
After all,

77
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:30,199
It's North City Old Industrial District.

78
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,279
Even if it won't sell for 100,000,

79
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,439
surely it can fetch 50,000?

80
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,240
Wait.

81
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,959
Where did you say the old house was?

82
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:39,000
In the North City Old Textile Mill dorms.

83
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,480
Why?

84
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:42,399
The North City old district...

85
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,560
How could I have forgotten about that?

86
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:46,439
In my past life, wasn't it around now

87
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:47,560
the North City Old Industrial District

88
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,600
was zoned into the new commercial center?

89
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:52,639
The demolition payouts were insane,

90
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:55,720
making so many people rich overnight!

91
00:04:59,279 --> 00:04:59,879
Sister-in-law,

92
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,399
you absolutely cannot sell that house!

93
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,240
Not only can't you sell it,

94
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,839
tell your dad to keep the property deed

95
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,759
and not hand it to anyone!

96
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:06,959
Before the demolition notice drops,

97
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,319
I need to snap up as many as I can.

98
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:13,040
The only question is,

99
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,439
on this pretty lady's card,

100
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:15,759
how much can I actually swipe?

101
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,879
I'll borrow your funds for now.

102
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,360
Don't worry,

103
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,519
I'll pay you interest!

104
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,720
Taxi!

105
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,240
Where to?

106
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,439
The North City old district.

107
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,079
Got it.

108
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,759
We've looked for days now.

109
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,160
You've got to be satisfied with this one, right?

110
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,000
This one faces north.

111
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,199
Not good enough.

112
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,000
Why not just say the feng shui is bad?

113
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,319
Look here, big boss.

114
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,800
How about wearing pants

115
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,480
that actually fit your butt?

116
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:53,240
This is already the 15th place we've seen.

117
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:54,199
If you ask me,

118
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,279
that ten-square-meter studio just now

119
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,079
was pretty good.

120
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:58,800
Ten square meters is too small.

121
00:05:58,920 --> 00:05:59,639
The value for money

122
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:00,680
isn't worth it.

123
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,439
You think it's too small?

124
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,720
You've got cabbage money,

125
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,120
but you're shopping for a palace.

126
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:08,759
You really think our agency is a wishing well?

127
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,399
Being so picky...

128
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,399
You're so full of it.

129
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,079
Looking down on me?

130
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:16,639
I'm only buying large units.

131
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,319
On this old street,

132
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:22,240
a large unit costs 200,000.

133
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:22,920
If you can actually

134
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,439
pay in full for a large one today,

135
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:27,439
I'll even wash my hair doing a handstand!

136
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,160
Lock it down first.

137
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,120
We'll worry about paying later.

138
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,439
That ten-square-meter one...

139
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:37,560
So you still want the ten-square-meter one?

140
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,399
No.

141
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,920
The other 14 units,

142
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,439
I'll take them all.

143
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,639
What the hell?

144
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,839
Fourteen units?

145
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,319
Did you get heatstroke

146
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:49,920
and start talking crazy to me?

147
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,560
Since you're the exclusive agent,

148
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,920
let's sign the contracts at your office.

149
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,680
What you said just now...

150
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,120
does it still count?

151
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:04,879
Of course, Boss Ma!

152
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,720
It definitely counts!

153
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:07,240
As long as you sign the contracts,

154
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,639
I'll do whatever you want.

155
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:10,439
Your word means more than my dad's!

156
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:14,839
Right this way.

157
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:18,439
Watch your step!

158
00:07:31,959 --> 00:07:33,920
About North City Old Street's demolition,

159
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:34,480
our project team

160
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,079
has completed preliminary preparations.

161
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:39,120
Finance has estimated the compensation.

162
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:41,839
We will proceed according to protocol:

163
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:45,160
First, quickly review the estimate,

164
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,560
based on the Old Street resident survey,

165
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,720
to refine the compensation plan,

166
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,759
separating residences from storefronts.

167
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:52,800
First deal closed!

168
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:55,879
The payment really went through!

169
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:58,480
Thank you for your trust, Boss Ma!

170
00:07:58,639 --> 00:08:02,759
Thank you, Boss Ma! Thank you, Boss Ma!

171
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,600
I'll do a special stunt for you:

172
00:08:04,959 --> 00:08:14,279
Wash my hair doing a handstand!

173
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,639
Boss Ma, what about the rest of the payment?

174
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:17,600
Swipe again.

175
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:19,399
Try swiping it.

176
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,480
185,000!

177
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,920
Boss Ma is awesome!

178
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,839
185,000!

179
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,360
Boss Ma is awesome!

180
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,080
200,000.

181
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:43,360
Keep going.

182
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,519
220,000.

183
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,399
Again.

184
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:50,399
220,000.

185
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:56,080
All hail Boss Ma! All hail Boss Ma!

186
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,639
You haven't worked up any lather.

187
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,559
Put some effort into it.

188
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,000
I've already gone easy on you.

189
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,360
Boss Ma is so righteous!

190
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,120
Boss Ma is so generous!

191
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,320
You're not just going easy on me...

192
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:04,360
I'll scrub you right away.

193
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:05,720
I promise I'll work this lather up...

194
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:07,759
...as high as your net worth!
